  "long_description": "Move Loot offers a much-needed service to individuals buying and selling used furniture. There is currently no option in the market that optimizes your time and money while offering this unique user-friendly experience. We realize that in order to avoid the hassle, you end up buying new... harming your wallet and the planet! \n\nMove Loot solves your dilemma by creating an online marketplace where users can post furniture to sell, find furniture to purchase, and select delivery personnel to complete the process.  Imagine online shopping meets ride-sharing meets an ice cream sandwich!",
